Hello there, I'm Pratyay Mustafi, a typical *professional amateur*
who wanders around the Internet, interested in linux, video games and technology in general
reading/listening to classical literature. Here you can only read the technical stuff but that's
not just some thing I am only interested in. I usually spend my days on reddit arguing with anons and sometimes
I contribute to open source projects. I generally waste my precious time editing, managing, tinkering with my [dotfiles]($link.url('https://github.com/Pratyay360/dotfiles'))
and Re imagining solutions to problems that don't even exist for most of the people.
Occasionally I brick my devices by over tinkering. I have good sense of humor, but the bad part is I crack dirty jokes with bad timing.
I have a bad habit of repeating myself on some things i am doing but not happening in the way i want it to.
Anyways, read more about me or what I do from this page.

- Practical Linux and dotfiles guides.
- Tauri and AppImage troubleshooting.
- Container and bootc experiments.
- Cloudflare deployment notes.

I usually spend my days on Reddit and contribute to open source. I enjoy tinkering, even when it bricks a device. Humor included, timing not guaranteed.
